# The blood-dose ladder's dose-8 arm (log 2026-09-12), kept as the
# record of what condbar144/condbar144b measured: under the clause's
# THIRD reading, outranged 8 meant the artillery share joined after
# eight kills to outranging ground movers, and on 96 untouched seeds
# that arm read 68 wins to the champion's 69 -- two flips, three
# regressions, a wash, and the reading was retired. Under the current
# CONCURRENCY reading (rw_bot.policy.counter, outranging_movers) this
# same file arms the join only while eight outranging movers stand at
# once, a rung of the concurrency ladder no batch has measured; the
# sibling evolve1-g4m2-cond carries threshold three and the ladder's
# falsification history. Every other knob and every goals slot is the
# champion's exactly.
